# Force LF for text files regardless of platform. Windows' core.autocrlf was silently
# converting LF to CRLF on checkout/stash, which broke byte-identical-copy invariants
# between D1 packs and their QA fixtures (hit repeatedly on 30 Aug 2026 — Uppsala, Oslo, Helsinki).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/generated assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
